{
  "name": "POLUNDER",
  "displayName": "The Rival's Papers",
  "sourceFile": "POLUNDER.txt",
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": 1000,
      "lines": [
        "<ce>      %pcf, _rival_ keeps an agent in _region_, and the",
        "<ce>      agent keeps papers: names, debts, promises. They",
        "<ce>      are at __hideout_ in ___hideout_. Bring them to",
        "<ce>      me within =traveltime_ days and _rival_ will find",
        "<ce>      its friends in _region_ fewer, and _seat_'s more.",
        "<ce>      The _gold_ gold is yours for the trouble.",
        "<ce>",
        "<ce>      Know this before you answer: this is a political",
        "<ce>      errand, and those set against _seat_ will think",
        "<ce>      the less of you for it: _against_.",
        "<ce>                     Will you do it?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1001,
      "lines": [
        "<ce>      Then you were never here, and neither was I."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1002,
      "lines": [
        "<ce>      The papers are at __hideout_ in ___hideout_.",
        "<ce>      Quietly, if you can. You have =traveltime_ days."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1003,
      "lines": [
        "<ce>      No papers yet, %pcf? _rival_ will not sit still",
        "<ce>                   for ever."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1004,
      "lines": [
        "<ce>      These will do nicely. By the turn of the month",
        "<ce>      half of _region_ will know what _rival_ promised",
        "<ce>      whom. Here is your _gold_ gold."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1005,
      "lines": [
        "<ce>      A bundle of papers, tied with _rival_'s cord."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1010,
      "lines": [
        "%qdt:",
        " _qgiver_ of ___qgiver_, for _seat_, wants the papers",
        " _rival_'s agent keeps at __hideout_ in ___hideout_.",
        " I have =traveltime_ days to bring them back. Those",
        " set against _seat_ will think the less of me for",
        " it: _against_."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1011,
      "lines": [
        "A ledger of _rival_'s friends in _region_: what",
        " each was promised, what each was paid, and what",
        " each would rather no one knew."
      ]
    }
  ],
